                <pb facs="0623" n="503" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg503"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Reid to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-11-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 15,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Reid reports that Lord Lansdowne has promised him that he will immediately
                    communicate with the colonial department and do everything possible.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
